sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser / External Site
    participant Gallery as brochure-gallery (:3004)
    participant Kong as Supabase Kong (:8000)
    participant PG as Postgres (tenant_brochures)
    participant MinIO as MinIO S3 (:9000 / cms-media)

    Browser->>Gallery: GET / or /b/[slug]
    Gallery->>Kong: SELECT * FROM public.tenant_brochures
    Kong->>PG: Query active tenant brochures
    PG-->>Gallery: Brochure rows + highlights + counters
    Browser->>Gallery: GET /api/brochure-svg/[slug]
    Gallery->>MinIO: PutObject cms-media/brochures/[slug].svg
    Gallery-->>Browser: High-res SVG Poster (CORS *)
    Browser->>Gallery: POST /api/brochures/[slug]/metric { metric: "shares" }
    Gallery->>Kong: RPC increment_brochure_metric(slug, "shares")
    Kong->>PG: Atomic counter +1
    PG-->>Browser: Updated telemetry counts
